{"table":"evidence","ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/evidence/R2-26-SR-044","record":{"id":"R2-26-SR-044","kind":"semantic_review","status":"not_run","command":[],"tool":"Source-located authored warrant; independent semantic review pending","source_ids":["scalar-r2-26-source-algorithm-application","support_tex_main","support_tex_variation"],"subject_ids":["scalar.separate_classical_algorithm","support.full_relative_support"],"details":"The algorithm proof applies thm:full-support to a minimizer to obtain the EAMS no-overlap-gap input. Attainment is supplied separately by the manuscript main.tex:94–107 and the existing scalar.minimizer_attainment support. The same attained gamma_0 is used for full support and strict increase. This authored application records the full-support input only, not a proof or formalization of the external algorithm theorem."},"usage":{"record_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/evidence/R2-26-SR-044","paper_focus":[],"paper_memberships":[{"stage":"long","subgraph_ref":"sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json/support/0.3.1/69473417dc487cafa5e2e39b3168d2c4a8bffdad2e91b6e486de48f122dda071","roles":["associated_record"]},{"stage":"short","subgraph_ref":"sha256:b3fb22a55f09aba18f53cd9bbac859142355ee389bba5aa7bf98d016dc611a43/papers/short.json/support/0.3.1/77f0cf29ab577b42d8caa5b2831ebfb1ca170d4b13c1ef6897cadc8e93c2a834","roles":["associated_record"]},{"stage":"expository","subgraph_ref":"sha256:082c1187f897999ee934fa70dbb519221ed1e0aebc169fac91b7211a4a599dc5/papers/expository.json/support/0.3.1/9dd5536bc567fc55efaa864733bf89747cea0268a8a3865dec51ddd8e2a235dd","roles":["associated_record"]}],"direct_passages":[]},"aligned_passages":[],"lenses":{},"relations":[{"family":"provenance","id":"field:0cffacb1d2c179fc752430df47f08d9247471c5e15f2a8da007e2ca798d3fcd2","from":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f9041932754